# Category test69 History

See `CONTRIBUTING.rst` for details of **required** info/format for each entry,
which **must** added in reverse chronological order (newest at the top). It must **not**
be used as a substitute for writing good git commit messages!


## 2023-10-20 Jean-Christophe David (test69-V11-01-01)
- Extension (by Demid Zharenov and Jean-Christophe David) of INCLXX for 
  in-flight antiproton interaction:
  added new macros: pbar_500MeV_C.in, pbar_5GeV_mix_long.in.
  added new macros: pbar_50MeV_C.in, pbar_50MeV_mix_long.in.

## 2023-05-15 Alberto Ribon (test69-V11-01-00)
- Extension (by Demid Zharenov and Jean-Christophe David) of INCLXX for 
  antiproton annihilation at rest:
  modified the class  Tst69INCLXXTallyAnalysis;
  added new macros: pbar_0MeV_C.in, pbar_0MeV_Pb.in pbar_100MeV_C.in.

## 2022-11-09 Vladimir Ivanchenko (test69-V11-00-01)
- test69.cc - use G4RunManagerFactory
- Tst69RunAction, Tst69INCLXXTallyAnalysis update Open() and Close()
  methods
- Tst69INCLXXTallyROOT - removed

## 2021-12-10 Ben Morgan (test69-V11-00-00)
- Change to new Markdown History format

